# Keeps this directory in git.
#
# It is currently empty -- the favicon moved to src/app/icon.svg and the
# create-next-app placeholder SVGs were unused -- but the panel
# Dockerfile does `COPY --from=build /repo/apps/panel/public`, which
# fails the build outright if the path does not exist. Git does not
# track empty directories, so without this file a fresh clone has no
# public/ and the image cannot be built. Deleting this file breaks
# production, not just this app's dev server.
